{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54371","headline":"赠道者 · 僧润","name":"赠道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一语真空出世间，可怜迷者蚁循环。\n此生胜坐三禅乐，好句常吟万事闲。\n秋月圆来看尽夜，野云散去落何山？\n到头自了方爲了，休执他经扣祖关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧润","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}